"description":"Hello Monke.\n\nRight now, I'm sure you have big goals, but find that doing the daily habits to achieve them is incredibly difficult.\n\nThis is how it is for monke too.\n\nAnd that is why he created this app. To make doing those habits easier, more consistently, and to have more fun when doing them.\n\nAt the start of any goal, it's almost like you're lost at sea. And that is how you start off in the Monke world.\n\nOn a small island, all alone.\n\nBut as you show up daily, completing small habits towards your goals, and completing focus sessions, you earn bananas and have the chance of unlocking other monke characters to join you on your journey.\n\nWith those bananas you can buy trees, tents, campfires and even pirate ships. You can also build new islands, and create a world that makes you want to keep coming back.\n\nThe more you do, the more fun your world becomes, and monke hopes that this will keep you coming back to complete your habits more and more.\n\nMonke thinks that this is the perfect app for any monke who struggles with staying consistent with their habits, or finds it hard to know what to do with their lives.\n\nSo Monke wants to welcome you to try it out.\n\nAll features require a paid subscription or one-time Lifetime purchase:\n\nLive Activity: See your focus timer progress when your phone is locked.\nDecorations: Lots of items to decorate your world with.\nCharacters: Different unlockable monke characters of varying rarity.\nEditable World: Make your world exactly as you want it. All items and characters can be moved anywhere on the map.\nStatistics: Level up your Monke character with 1 xp for each minute of focus. See your streak, and how long you focus for on average.\n\nMonke will even help you getting started with tasks, getting into the flow of your work, and reducing your screen time.\n\nSUBSCRIPTION INFORMATION\n\nAll features of \"Monke - Habit Game\" require a paid subscription (Monthly or Yearly) or a one-time Lifetime purchase. Payment will be charged to your iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase.\n\nYour subscription will automatically renew unless auto-renew is turned off in your iTunes Account Settings at least 24 hours before the current period ends. You can manage your subscription and disable auto-renewal in your iTunes Account Settings. \n\nThe Lifetime purchase is a one-time payment and does not renew.\n\nTerms Of Use: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\nPrivacy Policy: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1CGngivR0SAqgOr4H9rprZ3M8XGzZ7k_3xzK21TJL0jA/edit?usp=sharing", "minimumOsVersion":"17.0", "trackCensoredName":"Monke - Habit Game", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/monke-habit-game/id6755640836?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "averageUserRating":4.8387799999999998590283212251961231231689453125, "sellerName":"MYLES NICHOLAS ROOT", "isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled":true, "userRatingCount":1960}]
